Ports crypto's token_usage.py (dedup by message id, subagent lower bounds,
cache tiers). A claude_code receipt fills usage from the newest transcript
or refuses; absent transcript records usage_source: unavailable;
--allow-null-usage needs a reason. Summary prints cost per evidence record
and usage coverage by runtime (today: claude_code 0/128, codex_cli 1/47).

